OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer sacked for 'reckless'
OL,4,Aabuse case handling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer with more than 20
OL,7,Fyears' service has been dismissed
OL,8,Fwithout notice after a misconduct panel
OL,9,Ffound he took a "seriously reckless"
OL,10,Fapproach to a domestic abuse case.
OL,12,FThe officer, known only as Officer A
OL,13,Fdue to reporting restrictions, advised
OL,14,Fa man how to avoid detection while
OL,15,Fbreaching a domestic violence
OL,16,Fprotection notice (DVPN) that barred
OL,17,Fhim from contacting his partner.
OL,19,FThe hearing, held at Lincolnshire
OL,20,FPolice's Nettleham headquarters, heard
OL,21,Fthe officer had failed to take positive
OL,22,Fsteps to protect an individual.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
