OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer sacked for 'reckless'
OL,4,Aabuse case handling
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Constable Paul Gibson said:
OL,7,F"Officer A didn't intend harm to come
OL,8,Fto the victim but had failed to regard
OL,9,Fthe serious history of incidents."
